+.. _cli-config:
+
+Show Configuration
+------------------
+
+The ``config`` command prints the loaded application's configuration as JSON.
+Values for keys containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or ``KEY`` are
+masked as ``***``.
+
+.. code-block:: text
+
+    $ flask config
